quo;s 6 grids in Thayer County has 75 years on record, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, February to March was 41% of normal and November to December was 37%, while July to August ran 142%. For grid 24129 the driest year was 1974 at 59%, and its preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 139.3.</p>"}
